Z||000014||sloGT||08-30-2001||07:38 PM||||Ambush,the nose came from pisa but I would not recomend buying it from them,qaulity was like to chimps found the fiberglass,it took alot of work to make it look right.I recomend buying it from fierodenny at <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/kento/F355.html.And" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/kento/F355.html.And</A>  if you get it buy it with grill and lights installed trust me you will save about 100 dollars.                                      minngreen,The powerplant is stock v6 auto.When I bought the car the old woman claimed that her husband had just had it rebuilt before he died (drove it about 2 months)but she could not find the paperwork I didnot care becouse It ran good and I just needed it till I got my 74 vette rebiult.But after finding this forum I sold the vette less engine to fix up the fiero I was going to put the sbc in it when even the smallest problem happens with the 2.8,well it has been 2 years and I have still NEVER had to work on it mechanically it's been the most dependable car I have ever owned.I will most likely start the bid at 2000-2500 with a down to earth reserve,not like some others I've seen on there. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
